        "endpoint": "Hold the suspended position for the set time without losing the grip or straight-arm position.",
        "controlledJoints": "Keep both elbows fully extended and do not deliberately pull the shoulders down or cycle the shoulder blades.",
        "supportAndPosture": "Support your full bodyweight through both hands with no foot assistance and no deliberate swing.",
